e current.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Source cross-current sections; no geographic edge pair or exact flow-normal projection extracted.","layer":"Subthermocline 20 cm/s isotach core. Reported core depths and vertical extent are context, not fixed width-layer limits.","time_convention":"Author summary across six 1978–1980 cruises. Individual figure dates do not date this characteristic width; no per-cruise or seasonal width series extracted.","boundary_rule":"Source defines the core as flow within the 20 cm/s isotach and reports about 120 km core width. This is not the net-flow boundary.","source_url":"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00121/23229/21063.pdf","source_citation":"Molinari, R. L., Voituriez, B., and Duncan, P. (1981), Observations in the subthermocline undercurrent of the Equatorial South Atlantic Ocean: 1978–1980, Oceanologica Acta 4(4), 451–456.","source_locator":"Printed p453/PDF p3, core definition and width paragraphs; abstract p451/PDF p1; methods/captions p452/PDF p2; net-flow boundary limitation p456/PDF p6.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-14","source_evidence_kind":"published_original_campaign_core_summary","extraction_method":"Transcribed the explicit contour-defined body core width after original-page review; no figure digitization or geographic edge inference.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"1978–1980 study · 20 cm/s core summary","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"whole_current_width_km":null,"annual_width_range_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Body about 120 km versus abstract about 100 km retained separately. Reference captions use 1000 db while prose uses 1000 m. Numerical width uncertainty and net-flow boundaries unknown.","remaining_gates":["R