nterval transcribed from full PDF prose. No figure digitized, route buffered or station distance interpreted as width.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"remaining_gates":["Review underlying observations, width boundaries and historical applicability.","Obtain regional repeated seasonal observations before annual variability or modern representative width.","Canonical measurement admission and release review."],"phase_label":"October-March (1978 regional summary)","phase_kind":"seasonal_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":[10,11,12,1,2,3],"calendar_source_locator":"Appendix II section II.1, printed II-2 / PDF page 13: October to March along California and Oregon coasts.","source_quality_note":"Historical regional summary from 1978, not a present-day width measurement. Vancouver Island penetration is conditional; 25 and 50 km off Tofino are observation locations, not width boundaries. The separately described 50 km California Undercurrent is a different layer and current."},{"id":"gaspe-regional-typical-width-range","current_id":"gaspe","name":"Gaspé Current","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_regional_summary","width_metric":"author_reported_current_width","approximate_width_km":null,"width_range_km":[10,20],"range_kind":"reported_typical_regional_width_span","is_confidence_interval":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"range_interpretation":"Source-reported typical regional width span; no single midpoint or representative width selected. Not a confidence interval, matched seasonal pair or annual extrema.","geographic_scope":"Gaspe Peninsula coastal jet described in thesis introductory regional synthesis; not a measured uniform width along the estuary-to-Magdalen reference corridor.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Not specified for this typical regional prose range.","layer":"Upper coastal jet, described in the first approximately 40 m; range not assigned to every depth.","time_convention":"Regional typical-width summary in February 2022 thesis introduction; the adjacent summer maximum-speed clause does not make this a measured summer width range. No matched winter/summer widths or dated survey interval assigned.","boundary_rule":"Author-reported typical width; no paired boundary coordinates or reproducible velocity threshold supplied for the range.","source_url":"https://semaphore.uqar.ca/2055/1/Theau_Leclercq_fevrier2022.pdf","source_citation":"Leclercq, Théau (2022), Observations des remontées et des plongées des eaux en bordure du courant de Gaspé, master's thesis in oceanography, UQAR-ISMER, February 2022.","source_locator":"Printed page 5 / PDF page 21, paragraph on typical width 10-20 km; printed page 14 / PDF page 30, English introduction, width can reach 20 km.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-03","source_publication_year":2022,"source_document_sha256":"b8244831f7e593b0f5da2861f44658ccc8e9c4822cb9fe3b122e2e1e5654ae25","source_evidence_kind":"published_regional_literature_summary","extraction_method":"Typical 10-20 km range transcribed from full thesis prose, with corroborating English upper-width statement. No figure digitized, midpoint manufactured or route buffered.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"remaining_gates":["Review original observational definitions and temporal/along-route support behind the synthesis.","Obtain paired boundaries and compatible repeat sections before seasonal widths, annual ranges or representative width.","Canonical measurement admission and release review."],"phase_label":"Regional typical width (2022 synthesis)","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"source_quality_note":"Literature summary in an observational thesis, not a new dated width measurement from its transects. Exact boundaries and uncertainty remain unspecified."},{"id":"north-cape-northern-2007-profile-scale","current_id":"north-cape","name":