ulhas","name":"Agulhas Current","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_eulerian_mean_section_span","width_metric":"coast_to_author_reported_mean_zero_isotach","width_metric_label":"ACT coast-to-mean-zero-isotach span","approximate_width_km":219,"width_range_km":null,"range_interpretation":"No width uncertainty or annual range reported. Other arrays, periods and model products are not seasonal limits.","geographic_scope":"ACT section near 34 S off South Africa; not the whole Agulhas Current.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Author cross-track ACT section; exact endpoints and normal angle not extracted.","layer":"Mean jet depth extent about 3000 m is context; no fixed width measurement layer assigned.","time_convention":"April 2010-February 2013 averaging period, month precision; no instantaneous or seasonal width series extracted.","boundary_rule":"Author-reported fixed offshore distance from the coast to the time-mean zero-velocity isotach; negative cross-track flow denotes southwestward jet.","source_url":"https://journals.ametsoc.org/view/journals/phoc/45/5/jpo-d-14-0119.1.xml","source_citation":"Beal, Elipot, Houk and Leber (2015), JPO 45, 1302-1324, doi:10.1175/JPO-D-14-0119.1.","source_locator":"Abstract and section 4; section 2a array period; section 3b boundary-layer transport definition (coast to time-mean zero isotach).","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-04","source_evidence_kind":"published_moored_eulerian_mean_section","extraction_method":"Transcribed author-reported scalar and boundary convention; no coordinates or raw velocities digitized.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"remaining_gates":["Inspect original source PDF and averaging convention.","Recover matched dated boundary coordinates and layer-supported seasonal widths.","Independent scientific admission."],"phase_label":"ACT mean section, April 2010-February 2013","phase_kind":"eulerian_mean_section_span","o